{"id":"6ea17c91dcff1011","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-axiom-of-choice.md","title":"Axiom of Choice","display":"df-axiom-of-choice — Axiom of Choice","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-axiom-of-choice","aliases":["58-df-axiom-of-choice","Axiom of Choice"],"display":"df-axiom-of-choice — Axiom of Choice","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-axiom-of-choice"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-axiom-of-choice</span><span>Axiom of Choice</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-axiom-of-choice — Axiom of Choice"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{C}\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal{C}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AC}_S\\in\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{AC}_S\\in\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}axiom-of-choice} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{AC}_S \\leftrightarrow\n\\forall \\mathcal{C}\\in V\\,\\left(\n(\\emptyset\\notin\\mathcal{C})\n\\to\n\\exists f\\in V\\,\\left(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\mathcal{C},\\bigcup\\mathcal{C})\n\\land \\forall A\\in\\mathcal{C}\\;(f(A)\\in A)\n\\right)\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}axiom-of-choice} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{AC}_S \\leftrightarrow\n\\forall \\mathcal{C}\\in V\\,\\left(\n(\\emptyset\\notin\\mathcal{C})\n\\to\n\\exists f\\in V\\,\\left(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\mathcal{C},\\bigcup\\mathcal{C})\n\\land \\forall A\\in\\mathcal{C}\\;(f(A)\\in A)\n\\right)\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>AC: equivalent to many statements about existence without construction</li>\n<li>Equivalents: well-ordering (any set can be well-ordered), Zorn (posets with chains have max elements)</li>\n<li>Countable choice (CC): enough for most analysis; countable choice from countable sets\n-Dependent choice (DC): for sequential construction in Polish spaces; stronger than CC</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Jech, The Axiom of Choice</li>\n<li>Herrlich, Axiom of Choice</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{C}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AC}_S\\in\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}axiom-of-choice} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{AC}_S \\leftrightarrow\n\\forall \\mathcal{C}\\in V\\,\\left(\n(\\emptyset\\notin\\mathcal{C})\n\\to\n\\exists f\\in V\\,\\left(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\mathcal{C},\\bigcup\\mathcal{C})\n\\land \\forall A\\in\\mathcal{C}\\;(f(A)\\in A)\n\\right)\n\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":1169,"backlinks":[{"id":"55b1d917f2b95856","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AC}_S$ (axiom-of-choice proposition, see [[../batch14/58-df-axiom-of-choice.md]])"},{"id":"b8d460646e93c3b1","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AC}_S\\in\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[./58-df-axiom-of-choice.md]])."},{"id":"576d33e6f68f255a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AC}_S\\in\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[./58-df-axiom-of-choice.md]])."},{"id":"942c41e472f56c72","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AC}_S\\in\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$（see [[./58-df-axiom-of-choice.md]]）"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-158","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-axiom-of-choice.md|58-df-axiom-of-choice]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751"]}